---
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<p class="section-label">The experience</p>
		<h2 id="experience-heading" class="heading-lg">
			Memories Transformed into Notes.
		</h2>
		<div class="exp-grid">
			<article class="card">
				<h3>Olfactory Mapping</h3>
				<p>
					Our algorithms map out your favorite scent profiles to develop an olfactory blueprint
					profile that travels with you across the globe.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="card">
				<h3>Digital Atelier</h3>
				<p>
					Access a first-of-its-kind digital atelier through the ScentNode dashboard, helping you
					become your own perfumer, wherever home is.
				</p>
			</article>
			<blockquote class="card-quote">
				<p>
					A fragrance should be the map of where you’ve been and the vision of where you’re going.
				</p>
			</blockquote>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.exp-grid {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.exp-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
			grid-template-rows: auto auto;
		}
		.card-quote {
			grid-column: 1 / -1;
		}
	}
</style>
